#NODE tStep 1 number 16 dof 2 unknown d value -0.025000000000000001
## Each cubic boundary basis integrates to 1/4, so each end reaction is +/-1.5/4.
#REACTION tStep 1 number 1 dof 1 value -0.375
#REACTION tStep 1 number 5 dof 1 value -0.375
#REACTION tStep 1 number 9 dof 1 value -0.375
